<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADS ENDS AT $41-1/4 (FIM 185.04).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADS ENDS AT $41-1/4 (FIM 185.04).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADS closed $0-1/4 higher at $41-1/4 in New York on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Its Wall Street closing equals about 185.04 markka. In Helsinki on Tuesday Nokia closed up 1.40 markka at 186.40.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADS (two shares) closed up $0-1/4 at at $33-1/4 on Wall Street overnight. The price equals about 74.58 markka. In Helsinki, Valmet closed 0.20 markka up at 75.00 markka.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADS closed down $0-1/4 at $20-7/8 in New York. The price equals about 93.66 markka. In Helsinki on Tuesday, Rauma closed 0.90 markka lower at 94.00 markka.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-0-680 50 248</p>
